recommend check-in (Keaton) -- THE ROSTER'S OWN DIGEST NOW READS BYTES, and the first thing it caught was the runner writing into the tree between its own two digests. YOUR GATE IS UNCHANGED AND SHARPER: rule_twin's drift is 38 over a ceiling of 36 because three vocabulary rules seated 20260828 have drifted SINCE, all three two_way, so %7's middle door opens for none -- the class is growing rather than standing. TWO THINGS I WOULD ASK FOR: the card has nine bytes of headroom and wants a condense, which touches lanes mid-round; and %374's finding means this pier can never earn --scoped while two reds sit at gates. MINE NEXT: the lane-safe choirs, drey 17 and acme_dx 11.
